    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/ed315bba8fe6497779d40eb8d6c1dbb0.avif?t=1754291891\" width=1178 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Paper Castle about?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca7 Gather and manage water to <strong>build, paint, and upgrade</strong> the structures of your Paper Kingdom. Find the right balance between resource economy and defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Trigger the <strong>Trial by Flames</strong> and alternate between water and sword to extinguish or repel enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Lead</strong> your troops to the frontlines and unleash devastating abilities to turn the tide of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Unlock</strong> new weapons, upgrades, and challenges to refresh your strategy with each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Climb the global leaderboards by aiming for the highest scores</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your Paper Castle survive the next wave?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/e9eaa09205b216cd41b5e77e94c883a4.avif?t=1754291891\" width=1178 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be part of the growing community and help shape the future of the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Share your feedback directly with the devs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Participate in building and improving the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Exchange tips, strategies, and high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Connect with other passionate players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See you there!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hectiq team</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/ed315bba8fe6497779d40eb8d6c1dbb0.avif?t=1754291891\" width=1178 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Paper Castle about?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca7 Gather and manage water to <strong>build, paint, and upgrade</strong> the structures of your Paper Kingdom. Find the right balance between resource economy and defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Trigger the <strong>Trial by Flames</strong> and alternate between water and sword to extinguish or repel enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Lead</strong> your troops to the frontlines and unleash devastating abilities to turn the tide of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Unlock</strong> new weapons, upgrades, and challenges to refresh your strategy with each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Climb the global leaderboards by aiming for the highest scores</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your Paper Castle survive the next wave?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/e9eaa09205b216cd41b5e77e94c883a4.avif?t=1754291891\" width=1178 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be part of the growing community and help shape the future of the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Share your feedback directly with the devs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Participate in building and improving the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Exchange tips, strategies, and high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Connect with other passionate players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See you there!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hectiq team</p>",
